  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h2> Hardware and Software Tool Management </h2>",
   "body": "<p>With ZOLLER Smart Cabinets, you always have grinding wheels and wheel packs quickly at hand. Each wheel is stored securely and can be located quickly. </p> <p>Supported by the ZOLLER Tool Management Solutions software, you gain full transparency into your inventory. You always know which wheels are currently in use on which machine and can see a package’s storage location and tool data at a glance. </p> <p>Learn more about ZOLLER Tool Management</p>",
